    "readme": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"logo.svg\" alt=\"Inkwell logo\" width=\"220\">\n</p>\n\n# Inkwell\n\nInkwell is a small inference engine written in C. It loads one model family, runs it on the GPU you have, and serves it over HTTP.\n\n## Build\n\nRun `make` and then `./inkwell --help`.\n"
